<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's BTA raises '96 div to 145 esc.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BTA raises '96 div to 145 esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese bank Banco Totta e Acores said a general assembly voted to raise the 1996 dividend to 145 escudos per share from 135 escudos earlier proposed by the board.  </p>
<p>In 1995, BTA issued an average dividend of 178 escudos per share.</p>
<p>BTA shares stood at 2,505 escudos, up 120, in volume of 223,011 shares at 1540 GMT.</p>
</text>
